  "limitations": [
    "The endpoint and IOMMU are virtual. R27 remains OPEN until target physical IOMMU, interrupt-remapping, platform errata, reset and workload qualification provide E4 evidence.",
    "This is a standalone Qman component/probe, not an integrated product controller, durable lease, launcher or post-start verification path. C21 remains IMPLEMENTATION_BLOCKED.",
    "The independent guest sysfs reader is an unsigned lab fixture. snapshotEpoch and topologyHash are explicitly CALLER_CORRELATION_ONLY and do not prove the authoritative G1 inventory publisher, boot identity or full physical topology.",
    "The CLI intentionally closes the acquired session after proving bind and attach. It does not hand live descriptors to QEMU, and a pre-attached session is not a valid stock-QEMU product launch path because stock QEMU performs its own VFIO_DEVICE_BIND_IOMMUFD and IOAS attach.",
    "The positive integration used the cdev/IOMMUFD path. TYPE1v2/TYPE1 remain explicit lab-only unit-tested fallbacks and the NOIOMMU extension is never accepted.",
    "No production DPDK coexistence workload, physical device state validation, VF token flow, sPAPR path or multi-device dependency bundle was exercised."
  ]
